description "Jango Fett

Known in his heyday as one of the greatest bounty hunters in the galaxy. Boasts an array of lethal weapons and gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Jango's WESTAR-34 Blaster Pistols (3)
-- Non-disarmable
-- 5% faster RoF
-- 5% faster velocity
-- 5% more damage/FP damage
-- Primary fire only
- Wrist Flamethrower (Thrower)
-- 20% slower RoF
-- 7900% slower reload

^6Inventory:
- Binoculars

^8Attributes:
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (1)
- Fuel Regen: 1/1.1s
- Tracking Beacon
- 15% less knockback taken
- 5% less knockback given
- 25% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Rocket ^3[CS1]
-- Staggers on det
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Velocity-7 Poison Dart Shooter (4) ^3[Melee ^3CS3]
-- Tracks on hit
-- 100% more damage
- Gun Kick ^3[CS4]
- Jetpack
-- No cooldown"
